From 1941469c786bc36ac9ab1f9346f453cff725731a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 10:58:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] docs(process): name the documentation site as step 5 of the
 release cut

AGENTS.md's cut steps now say the tag run's site and pages jobs
regenerate and deploy the Zola site (and the browser build at /app/),
and that the cut is done once pages is green and the live site shows
the new version. A red pages job is re-run, never fixed by moving the
tag. PROCESS_VERSION 53 -> 54.

This was the last open "Done means" item of #688: the site, its version
and download links, the Pages deploy and the browser build (#1103) had
all shipped.

Fixes #688

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
